{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/060-wan-lan/wangli-yundu","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/060-wan-lan/wangli-yundu/data.json","title":"詩經韻讀 · 芄蘭 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 衛風 · 芄蘭 · 汇集《詩經韻讀》关于《芄蘭》的 1 条注释，含 1 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"060-wan-lan","materialId":"wangli-yundu"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/060-wan-lan/wangli-yundu","poem":{"id":"060-wan-lan","title":"芄蘭","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"weifeng","path":["風","衛風","芄蘭"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"芄兰之支","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"童子佩觿","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"虽则佩觿","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"能不我知","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"容兮遂兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-006","text":"垂带悸兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-007","text":"芄兰之叶","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-008","text":"童子佩韘","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-009","text":"虽则佩韘","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-010","text":"能不我甲","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-011","text":"容兮遂兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-012","text":"垂带悸兮","isActive":true}]},"material":{"id":"wangli-yundu","title":"詩經韻讀","authors":["王力"],"contributorLine":"现代 · 王力","era":"现代","publicationYear":1980,"carrier":"PDF"},"stats":{"annotationCount":1,"glossCount":1},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":1,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"芄兰之支，童子佩觿，虽则佩觿，能不我知，容兮遂兮，垂带悸兮。芄兰之叶，童子佩韘，虽则佩韘，能不我甲，容兮遂兮，垂带悸兮。","targetNotes":"全篇通释。","sourceLabel":"第 173-174 页","sourceNotes":"书页 173-174《芄兰》韵读。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","text":"王力《诗经韵读》收《芄兰》二章六句，正文作简体“芄兰之支”“芄兰之叶”，并保留“能不我甲”这一关键语词。若从声韵与句法看，两章反复结构正是通过重章强调幼主徒饰威仪而无实才。","notes":null}]}]}}}
